-- Tameable beasts that teach at least one pet ability rank on WoW: Forever.
-- Which beast knows which rank is server-side data - no client DB has it. This
-- list is Petopia's Forever list (wow-petopia.com/forever/abilities.php, fetched 2026-11-23) over
-- the Classic Era list (Petopia Classic) for the beasts it does not cover,
-- filtered against the Forever skill lines; all of it unverified = true
-- (neither says which entries were seen in game). On top: beasts confirmed on
-- Forever (tools/ForeverPetData/confirmed_sources.csv: community reports,
-- beastmaster.io's dated changelog, our own PetTipsDB.tameLog). A confirmed
-- beast keeps older ranks nobody has confirmed yet - those are listed in
-- unverified = { spellIds } (the "?" is per rank). Zone IDs: positive =
-- uiMapID, negative = -instanceMapID; the English zone string is only a
-- fallback.
--
-- mob(npcId, name, familyId, minLevel, maxLevel, zone, { zoneIds }, { spellIds }, unverified)

